[00:01.314][Verse 1]
[00:01.564]When things are right, then you just know
[00:04.577]There is something in your eyes that brings me home
[00:08.340]'Cause when there's love, you don't let go
[00:12.606]So as long as you're with me, you're not alone, you'll never be
[00:15.115]
[00:16.620][Pre-Chorus]
[00:16.871]I wanna tell you what I feel and really mean it
[00:20.886]I wanna shout it from the rooftops to the sky
[00:24.900]'Cause if you ever need a friend, you know I'll be it
[00:29.168]From tonight until we see the end of time
[00:30.423]
[00:32.930][Chorus]
[00:33.432]I'll cross my heart and hope to die
[00:37.950]We're always and forever I'll be by your side
[00:41.620]When days are dark and stars don't align
[00:45.889]We're always and forever 'til the end
[00:49.655]The end of time
[00:50.406]
[01:06.985][Verse 2]
[01:07.236]When we look back and when we're old
[01:10.495]We'll see your footprints next to mine along the road
[01:14.922]And I don't know what the future holds
[01:18.935]But as long as you're with me, you're not alone, you'll never be
[01:22.950]
